{
  "$schema": "../../../../schemas/programUnits.schema.json",
  "_comment": [
    "The identity provider's menu fragment (docs/identity_provider_platform_PRD.md D9). Each unit shows",
    "only to callers holding Query on its type, so a signed-in user who is not a developer sees none of the",
    "OIDC units. The decision queue is the Approvals library's pending-approvals query (developer requests,",
    "cross-owner scopes, go-live reviews): every signed-in user may query it and sees only the requests they",
    "raised or may decide.",
    "An application removes a unit with { \"id\": \"…\", \"$remove\": true } in its own programUnits.json."
  ],
